<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.8010.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.8010.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8010 against the dollar, up from 2.8040 on Thursday and at 1.8380 per mark, up from 1.8420, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
